# Evidence-Based Architecture Trade-off Review

> Reusable report template for {{PROJECT_NAME}}. Review every registered
> `DREG-####` exactly once, including accepted, selected, open, evidence-first,
> deferred, and superseded entries. Preserve current accepted authority until
> an amendment or successor `DEC-####` is accepted. Scores never grant
> authority or prove implementation readiness.

