### Disposition and compatibility

Disposition must be one of: `reaffirm`, `reaffirm with clarification`,
`reaffirm pending evidence`, `change recommendation`,
`challenge owner selection`, `amend through successor decision`,
`supersede through successor decision`, `reopen as evidence-first`,
`retain deferred`, `no longer material`, or `not assessable yet`.

Compatibility is `compatible`, `tension`, `conflict`, or `unknown`.

